DESCRIPTION:The sun lines up with Horsetail Fall in the second half of Febr
 uary. In 2026 the park's projected window was February 10 to 26\, with no 
 reservation required. The fall only glows if there is water in it and the 
 western sky is clear. Typical window\, not a published date\; the park ann
 ounces the day a few days ahead. Source: https://www.nps.gov/yose/learn/ne
 ws/yosemite-national-park-prepares-for-2026-horsetail-fall-viewing.htm. Ve
 rified 2026-09-05. The Talus Field\, https://thetalusfieldjournal.com/date
